&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Executives are key drivers of Jumio’s growth through leading new customer acquisition. You will be responsible for identifying and progressing opportunities, managing the sales cycle, and negotiating successful contracts in order to commence long term partnerships with new enterprise customers. Helping them to eliminate identity fraud and making the digital world a safer place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growing Jumio’s pipeline, revenue and market share in a rapidly expanding domain is fundamental to Jumio’s continued success. Account Executives are at the heart of the company’s global expansion and directly impact revenue, profitability and EBITDA. New customers and new revenue streams increase the value of the business and the impact we make on improving the world of online identity verification.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering against agreed new business sales targets, revenue and new logo customer acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling into companies across a number of industries including Sharing Economy, Gaming, Fintech, Banking and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identification and development of opportunities with successful pipeline and process management through to deal completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market mapping and researching prospects and their business needs and drivers - building relationships across target customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking and event attendance and management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compelling articulation of Jumio’s offerings and competitive products, pricing and proposal models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closing deals resulting in the taking of market share from competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing contacts  through calls, emails, meetings and conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asking great questions to obtain detailed information to deliver effective solution presentations to prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining accurate records of all sales activities for purposes of maintaining and further developing the Jumio’s sales pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing lasting, positive and productive relationships with Jumio’s clients - securing referrals and testimonials that lead to new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working collaboratively with colleagues in pre-sales, marketing and account management to provide outstanding customer experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building relationships across Enterprise Accounts at the C-Level - achieving sales quotas of £1.5-2M+ per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven professional experience selling value-add software solutions to new logo customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing knowledge of the ID verification, AML or KYC market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent ability to identify and articulate value to customers through written and verbal communication&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting skills and experience of prioritizing potential clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven negotiation and closing skills,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting and financial planning and strategy skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in CRM - SFDC preferable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great to have Experience and Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established network of contacts in relevant industries and enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitor product awareness and insight&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree educated is preferred, not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing deal sizes ranging from £30,000 to £3M+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with sales cycles of between 3-9 months&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reseller / system integration channels in cyber security solutions / identity management solutions is advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is crucial, additional language skills (Spanish, Italian, French, etc) of interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Characteristics and Attitudes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambitious and driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and flexible&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate and persuasive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High IQ and EQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and coachable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially aware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient and tenacious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big picture and the detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example Objectives:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pipeline growth, forecast accuracy and booked revenue are the type of clear and consistent metrics that define success in the Account Executive position. Conversion ratios throughout the pipeline are also important, along with the growth of networks and contacts within Salesforce.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jumio Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;docs-Calibri&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;IDEAL: Integrity, Diversity, Empowerment, Accountability, Leading Innovation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;docs-Calibri&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;docs-Calibri&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;Jumio is a collaboration of people with different ideas, strengths, interests and cultures. We welcome applications and colleagues from all backgrounds and of all statuses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Jumio:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jumio is a B2B technology company dedicated to eradicating online identity fraud, money laundering and other financial crimes to help make the internet safer. We leverage AI, biometrics, machine learning, liveness detection and automation to create solutions that are trusted by leading brands worldwide and respected by industry thought leaders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jumio is the leading provider of online identity verification, eKYC and AML solutions. With a global footprint, we’re expanding the team to meet strong client demand across a range of industries including Financial Services, Travel, Sharing Economy, Fintech, Gaming, and others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Data Privacy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will only use your personal information in connection with Jumio’s application, recruitment, and hiring processes, as described in Jumio’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jumio.com/legal-information/privacy-notices/candidate-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt; If you have any questions or comments, please send an email to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:privacy@jumio.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy@jumio.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The Head of Identity &amp;amp; Regulatory Market Strategy sits within the Go-To-Market organization and translates global regulatory complexity into commercial advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role enables Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, and Product Marketing to win in regulated markets by turning identity, compliance, and trust requirements into clear positioning, differentiated solutions, and accelerated deal cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This position will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Jumio’s regulatory narrative across key verticals, including financial services, iGaming, marketplaces, and crypto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the bridge between regulation, product, and GTM execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Jumio as the trusted authority in identity intelligence and compliance to drive pipeline and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Turn regulatory complexity into a &lt;strong&gt;repeatable GTM advantage that drives pipeline, win rates, and expansion.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Strategy to GTM Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and anticipate global regulatory developments, including eIDAS 2.0, AI Act, DORA, and AML/KYC evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate regulatory change into GTM plays, target segments, and sales priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip teams with “what this means for the customer” messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Marketing to align regulatory triggers to pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like regulation directly influencing pipeline creation, prioritization, and deal strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verticalized GTM Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate regulatory requirements into industry-specific GTM narratives across financial services, crypto, iGaming, mobility, payments, marketplaces, and digital platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Marketing to build use-case-driven positioning, including onboarding, age verification, fraud prevention, and lifecycle monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable field teams with clear articulation of “why buy now” driven by compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like stronger industry positioning and improved win rates in regulated verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales and Customer Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop sales enablement assets, including battlecards, objection handling, and regulatory-triggered outreach plays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic deals by joining key customer conversations and providing regulatory credibility and assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Customer Success to drive expansion through regulatory change events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like faster deal cycles, higher close rates, and expansion driven by regulatory urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Positioning, Thought Leadership, and Market Presence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, evolve, and promote Jumio’s market narrative around digital identity, trust, compliance, and regulatory innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing and Communications to develop and execute thought leadership programs, including reports, webinars, PR, analyst engagement, and executive content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align messaging and market outreach with key regulatory milestones and strategic GTM priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a visible external voice for Jumio through industry events, speaking engagements, webinars, media opportunities, LinkedIn, and other digital channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen relationships and credibility with buyers, regulators, analysts, industry influencers, and ecosystem partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Jumio as the category leader in identity intelligence, trust, and compliance solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like increased market visibility and inbound demand, stronger deal credibility, enhanced analyst and regulator relationships, and elevated category leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certification and Trust as a Revenue Lever&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define Jumio’s certification roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize certifications based on deal impact and market access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate certifications into clear commercial value and differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like certifications actively used to win deals and unlock new markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Entry and Expansion Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess regulatory readiness for new markets and segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM leadership to prioritize markets based on regulatory tailwinds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De-risk expansion decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable market entry frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like faster, lower-risk expansion into high-value regulated markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem and External Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with regulators, industry bodies, and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Jumio in industry forums, policy discussions, and standards groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring insights back to influence product roadmap and GTM strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success looks like early insight into regulatory shifts and increased market influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–15+ years of experience in financial services regulation, AML/KYC, digital identity, or a closely related area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulatory advisory, either in consulting or in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in European frameworks, including eIDAS and AML/KYC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging with regulators and financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in identity verification, fraud, or digital identity platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with certification frameworks, including ETSI, ISO, and SOC2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in tier 1 bank compliance, Big 4 regulatory advisory, RegTech, or identity platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and GTM Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect regulation to pipeline creation, deal acceleration, and revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Translation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Converts complex regulation into clear, actionable GTM strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplifies complex topics for customers, sales teams, and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable acting as a public-facing thought leader and industry voice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives alignment across Sales, Marketing, Product, and Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates effectively without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and outcome-oriented, with a commercial rather than academic mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly credible with customers and regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward-looking and strategic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship builder and influencer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Great Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;A good candidate has a deep understanding of global regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;An exceptional candidate uses regulation to drive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Higher win rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faster deal cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expansion into new regulated markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jumio Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;docs-Calibri&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;IDEAL: Integrity, Diversity, Empowerment, Accountability, Leading Innovation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;docs-Calibri&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;docs-Calibri&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;Jumio is a collaboration of people with different ideas, strengths, interests and cultures. We welcome applications and colleagues from all backgrounds and of all statuses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Jumio:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jumio is a B2B technology company dedicated to eradicating online identity fraud, money laundering and other financial crimes to help make the internet safer. We leverage AI, biometrics, machine learning, liveness detection and automation to create solutions that are trusted by leading brands worldwide and respected by industry thought leaders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jumio is the leading provider of online identity verification, eKYC and AML solutions. With a global footprint, we’re expanding the team to meet strong client demand across a range of industries including Financial Services, Travel, Sharing Economy, Fintech, Gaming, and others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Data Privacy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will only use your personal information in connection with Jumio’s application, recruitment, and hiring processes, as described in Jumio’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jumio.com/legal-information/privacy-notices/candidate-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt; If you have any questions or comments, please send an email to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:privacy@jumio.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy@jumio.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

